<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Online Resume</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f4f4f9;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    header {
      background: #2c3e50;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    header p {
      margin: 5px 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .grid-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .sidebar {
      background: #ecf0f1;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .sidebar h2 {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .main-content {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .main-content h2 {
      border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .flex-section {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .flex-section h3 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }

    .flex-section span {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: #777;
    }

    ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }

    ul li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 15px;
      background: #2c3e50;
      color: #fff;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Shubham  </h1>
    <p>Web Developer | Student | Programme </p>
    <p>Email: shubham@example.com | Phone: +91-8685864970</p>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid-layout">
      <!-- Sidebar -->
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <h2>Profile</h2>
        <p>Motivated BCA student with skills in web development, programming, and data analysis. Passionate about building clean and functional projects.</p>

        <h2>Skills</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li>
          <li>Python, C Programming</li>
          <li>Excel & Data Analysis</li>
          <li>Crypto Trading Basics</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Education</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>BCA - Geeta University</li>
          <li>Class 12th - HBSC</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <section class="main-content">
        <h2>Experience</h2>
        <div class="flex-section">
          <h3>Intern - Web Development</h3>
          <span>2025 - Present</span>
        </div>
        <p>Worked on creating responsive websites using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Learned about Flexbox and Grid for layout design.</p>

        <div class="flex-section">
          <h3>Freelance E-commerce Seller</h3>
          <span>2024 - 2025</span>
        </div>
        <p>Started selling products on Meesho, focusing on beginner-friendly categories like fashion jewelry.</p>

        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>HTML Registration Form with multiple input types</li>
          <li>Crypto Futures Trading Analysis using Excel</li>
          <li>Portfolio Website showcasing coding projects</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 Shubham| Online Resume</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>>





